        "text": "<!-- ai-erd:begin -->\n## AI-ERD Harness\n\nThis repository uses AI-ERD as its design source of truth, and each session has one role\n(Design / Development / Test / Validation). Read `.ai-erd/HARNESS.md` before doing work that\ntouches requirements, the ERD, or architecture.\n\nThe role of this session comes from the `ai-erd` MCP server configuration that\n`ai-erd init` wrote; the server states it in its `initialize` instructions and exposes only\nthat role's tools. If the work needs something outside the role,\nstop and report which session is required.\n<!-- ai-erd:end -->"
